```

The current English text as a real, importable constant — exported so
overriding just one key can spread the rest from this rather than
retyping every default. Not re-exported from this package's own
barrel — both this constant and the `IGridAriaLabels` interface itself
come from `keystone-dashboard-layout-core` directly:

```tsx
import { DEFAULT_ARIA_LABELS, type IGridAriaLabels } from 'keystone-dashboard-layout-core';

const gridAriaLabels: IGridAriaLabels = {
  ...DEFAULT_ARIA_LABELS,
  closeButton: 'Supprimer cet élément',
};
```

